<ProjectPage
    title="Freedom CTF"
    description="A capture-the-flag platform built at 17. International events, 200+ teams, 50k requests per second at peak."
    lede="A capture-the-flag platform built at 17 and run for international teams."
    figureLabel="Fig. 04 — Freedom CTF"
    figureAlt="Schematic of a capture-the-flag service with a flag and a score path."
    plate="ctf"
    primary={{ href: "#status", label: "Status" }}
    aboutTitle="The platform."
    sectionId="status"
    sectionTitle="Status."
    sectionLede="Built and operated in 2020–21. No public repository is linked from this site."
>
    <Fragment slot="prose">
        <p>
            Built at 17. A cybersecurity competition platform, written and
            run for international events in 2020–21. The site record is 200+
            registered teams and 50k requests per second at peak.
        </p>
        <p>
            The stack named for it is Go, Flask, and the infrastructure under
            the events. This page does not point at a later CTF fork. Freedom
            CTF 2020–21 is the event this record describes.
        </p>
    </Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="facts">
        <div>
            <dt class="t-label">Years</dt>
