        </div>
        <div>
            <dt class="t-label">Built at</dt>
            <dd>17</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
            <dt class="t-label">Teams</dt>
            <dd>200+</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
            <dt class="t-label">Peak</dt>
            <dd>50k requests/sec</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
            <dt class="t-label">Stack</dt>
            <dd>Go, Flask, infrastructure</dd>
        </div>
    </Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="steps">
        <li>
            <p class="t-label">01</p>
            <div class="prose">
                <h3>What ran</h3>
                <p>
                    A capture-the-flag platform, built from scratch, hosting
                    international events. 200+ registered teams. 50k requests
                    per second at peak.
                </p>
            </div>
        </li>
        <li>
            <p class="t-label">02</p>
            <div class="prose">
                <h3>What is not linked</h3>
                <p>
                    There is no source repository, challenge archive, or
                    operations write-up on this site. The numbers above are
                    the public record.
                </p>
            </div>
        </li>
    </Fragment>
</ProjectPage>
